      "standard": "W3.b",
      "type": "fractional-exp",
      "question_html": "Solve: \\( x^{2/3} = 9 \\)",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "q1_x",
          "type": "number",
          "label": "x =",
          "answer": 27,
          "tolerance": 0.01
        }
      ],
      "hint": "Raise both sides to the 3/2 power. The 2/3 and 3/2 cancel.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "x^(2/3) = 9.",
        "Raise both sides to the 3/2 power: x = 9^(3/2).",
        "9^(1/2) = 3, then 3³ = 27.",
        "Check: 27^(2/3) = (27^(1/3))² = 3² = 9 ✓"
      ],
      "feedback_correct": "🔥 9^(3/2) = 27. You know the move.",
      "feedback_wrong": "Raise BOTH sides to the 3/2 power. The exponent 2/3 flips to 3/2."
    },
    {
